# Cereal loop 2: a mint cereal loop (kitchen_cereal_mint), 0.78 m across and 0.2 m thick (60 times life size), a ring with a flat-topped tube, lying flat on the
# worktop. Ground clutter: no collider.
format 1

# A fifth of the vertices its size would give it: a smooth ring
Detail detail=0.05
    Material material=kitchen_cereal_mint
        Translate translation=(0, 0.1, 0)
            Intersection
                Torus innerRadius=0.14 outerRadius=0.39
                Box size=(0.5, 0.1, 0.5)
